WEBVTT

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:00.101
stay abreast of the latest trends

00:08:00.125 --> 00:08:03.458
and often discover things
that you didn't even know existed.

00:08:04.458 --> 00:08:07.101
And finally, my favorite example:

00:08:07.125 --> 00:08:08.393
Pinduoduo,

00:08:08.417 --> 00:08:11.184
one of the fastest-growing
Chinese platforms,

00:08:11.208 --> 00:08:14.518
where you can actually shop
with your friends online.

00:08:14.542 --> 00:08:16.018
You remember the fun I had

00:08:16.042 --> 00:08:18.601
shopping with my friends
on Fashion Street,

00:08:18.625 --> 00:08:20.101
rummaging through stores,

00:08:20.125 --> 00:08:22.351
finding that perfect sandal,

00:08:22.375 --> 00:08:24.643
negotiating that great deal?

00:08:24.667 --> 00:08:26.143
Well, on Pinduoduo,

00:08:26.167 --> 00:08:27.958
you can do just that.

00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:31.292
It's lonely to shop online,